{
  "uid": "fespalier-actions",
  "title": "fespalier · Actions",
  "description": "What people do (each function in an action.dart), and whether it works.",
  "tags": [
    "fespalier"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "fespalier",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "fespalier"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "App",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(fespalier_calls, service_name)",
          "refId": "service"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What an action is",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "An **action** is a function in an `action.dart`: a tap that changes something, like saving or paying. **Failed** means it threw. Colours as on App health: 🟢 good · 🟠 needs attention · 🔴 bad · grey: not enough data yet."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "How many actions ran?",
      "description": "Every call of an action.dart function in this time range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "How often do actions fail?",
      "description": "Share of action.dart runs that threw. Good: under 1 %. If not: Actions lists the failing action and Errors its error type; check its validate() and the server's answer.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range])) - sum(sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\", fespalier_action_result=\"ok\"}[$__range]))) / sum(sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range])) and on() (sum(sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range])) >= 20)",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "Not enough data yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Do actions finish quickly?",
      "description": "How long an action.dart takes, from the tap to its result, slowest 5 %. Good: under 1 s. If not: Actions shows which one; consider optimistic() so the screen answers at once.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (sum_over_time(fespalier_duration_bucket{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range]))) and on() (sum(sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range])) >= 20)",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1000
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3000
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "Not enough data yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "How many actions failed?",
      "description": "Runs that threw. Good: none. If not: the table below names the action; Errors has the error type and message.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\", fespalier_action_result=\"error\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open Errors",
              "url": "/d/fespalier-errors?${__url_time_range}&${service:queryparam}"
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Which actions are slow or failing?",
      "description": "Each action with its runs, failure rate, typical and slowest-5 % time. File is the action.dart to open.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (fespalier_action_name, fespalier_file) (sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum by (fespalier_action_name, fespalier_file) (sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range])) - sum by (fespalier_action_name, fespalier_file) (sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\", fespalier_action_result=\"ok\"}[$__range]))) / sum by (fespalier_action_name, fespalier_file) (sum_over_time(fespalier_calls{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, fespalier_action_name, fespalier_file) (sum_over_time(fespalier_duration_bucket{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, fespalier_action_name, fespalier_file) (sum_over_time(fespalier_duration_bucket{fespalier_operation=\"action\", service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
